             452                     !
             453                     !  compute the effective size for cloud droplets
             454                     !
             455                     !  1.the formulation of effective size for water clouds same as the one
             456                     !    used by McFarlane et al. (1992) in Canadian climate model
             457                     !  2.effective size for ice clouds based on the table2 of Fu (1996), which
             458                     !    is organized from data of HP (1984).
